      "widgets_values": [
        "## Anime Upscale\n\nRemoves watermarks, then upscales 2x with **tile ControlNet + IPAdapter + Ultimate SD Upscale**. The prompt is the one embedded in the picture (when there is one) plus quality tags. No Grok or Civitai calls.\n\n**One picture:** pick it in *Load picture* and Run.\n**A folder:** in *Choose the input*, switch to *Input: folder*. Pick the folder in the Load Image Batch node (under ComfyUI's input), put the same folder in *Same folder as a path*, and set Run's batch count to the number of pictures. Each run takes the next picture.\n\nWatermarks are found with OCR, erased with Big-LaMa and the spots repainted with the checkpoint; check *Watermark mask* if it removes too much (raise min_confidence)."
      ],
      "title": "How to use"
    }
